ALBUKHR Testnet Owner Application — Phase 3 Integration Contract
Status: Read-only source-tracing and implementation contract.
Prepared: 2026-10-30
Deployment status: Not deployed. No production database, Edge Function, repository, or Render service was changed.
This package follows the approved Phase 2 scope. It translates the live Mainnet/Testnet source findings into an exact integration design for the next coding phase.
Files
design/PHASE3_INTEGRATION_CONTRACT.md — end-to-end architecture and API contracts.
source-baseline/LIVE_SOURCE_BASELINE.md — exact deployed and repository files inspected.
tests/PHASE3_REGRESSION_GATES.md — security, workflow, and financial regression gates.
Non-negotiable preservation rules
Do not alter the seven Core project workflow or existing albukhr-admin Core Admin path.
Do not use or modify the legacy Owner assignment workflow for self-applications.
Do not modify RAHEEM-25 binding, Owner balances, ledger, withdrawals, payout verification, or identity-link flow.
Do not modify Dock Navigation.
Do not send Mainnet users.id / owner_albukhr_user_id to Testnet browser clients or public registry responses.
Do not write to Mainnet from Testnet application, review, or approval flows.
Do not deploy or apply migrations before source implementation and regression review.
